==Battleground==
*1 [[Doge Dark]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*1 [[Doge Dark]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*1 [[Doge Dark]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Shadow Boxer K]] spawns after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*1 [[Shadow Boxer K]] spawns after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Yuma Kuga & Doge]] spawns as the boss.
**12 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**3 [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
**3 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn, delay 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The Shadow Boxer Ks and Gory Darks can make this stage quite hard for some newer players, so go in with anti-Dark units like [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Ring Girl Cat]] and spammable attackers like [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] with tough meatshields like [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Wall Cat]] and [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Eraser Cat]].

